# A text box's placeholder (a watermark while it is empty) and how a
# colour set afterwards and typing interact with it.
create window into app
app has title "Placeholder", width 360, height 260
create text box into plain
plain has width 240
placeholder of plain is "Your name"
create text box into coloured
coloured has width 240
placeholder of coloured is "Coloured"
background of coloured is "LightYellow"
create text box into filled
filled has width 240, text "already here"
placeholder of filled is "never seen"
foreground of filled is "green"
put plain, coloured, filled in app
show app
say "plain:" text of plain "placeholder:" placeholder of plain
